    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">[[/attack extended]]. [[/damage average extended]]. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the &amp;Reference[Grappled apply=false] condition (escape DC [[lookup @skills.ath.passive]]) from all four tentacles.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: A Medium or smaller creature hit is Grappled (CAT's grapple, escape DC from the check activity); while it grapples one, the grick can't target another with Tentacles.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
